						<p class="pDate">Tuesday, December 11, 2001</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Nomad 
						</p>
						<p class=pText>
						Nomad , lvls 20-50, has a temporary site at www.angelfire.com/home/nomad, does weekly Nomad Dungeon Training, quest Hunts, Nomad Market Day once a month and nightly Rez Patrols when we regroup again. Negotiations with Avalanche of Power, www.geocities.com/avalancheofpower to accept True Vision , the top end guild to Nomad 50+ characters and cheer up Nomad Hunts by adding their alts 20 - 50 to Nomad. The remaining TV to join AoP r Elizah,shm;Lathar,shm;Vulut, shm;Skyewalker,shm;Janetica,shm;Rozie,drd;Deeds,drd;Rinn,enc;Parvo,enc;Justinian,clr;Maximos,pal;Gumdaar,war;Tonoo,war;Stormaxe,war;Vaporz,mnk;and maybe Atstalia,wiz,still sorting thru rollcall after an offline absence. -Deeds Eyedew, lvl 50 Druid, Communications Officer for Elizah MacKool, 53 Shawoman
						<br>
						 - Elizah/Deeds<BR><BR>
						</p>
